                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "The table lists sports absent from the programme as of 2016, which is not the same as gone for good. Rugby returned in 2016 as Rugby Sevens and sits in this data as a separate sport, so the Rugby row ending in 1924 understates it. Baseball and softball returned at Tokyo 2020, after this dataset ends.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "12pt"
                    }
